#: ../../intro.md
msgid "`/api/upload`"
msgstr "`/api/upload`"

#: ../../intro.md
msgid "统一 `/api/v2/upload`，客户端用 PAT 鉴权（配置见[快捷上传](usage.md)）"
msgstr ""
"A single `/api/v2/upload`, authenticated with a PAT (see [Quick "
"upload](usage.md))"

#: ../../intro.md:15
msgid "版本号见 `server/sapic/version.py` 的 `__version__`，后台侧栏也会显示当前版本与是否有更新。"
msgstr ""
"The version is `__version__` in `server/sapic/version.py`; the admin "
"sidebar also shows the current version and whether an update exists."

#: ../../intro.md:17
msgid "已提供的能力"
msgstr "What it does"

#: ../../intro.md:19
msgid "**上传**：表单文件、远程 URL（服务端抓取，含私网地址拦截）、拖拽与粘贴、批量队列； 后缀白名单与按媒体类型（图片 / 视频）区分的大小上限。"
msgstr ""
"**Upload**: form files, remote URLs (fetched server-side, with private-"
"network blocking), drag and drop, paste and batch queues; an extension "
"allowlist and separate size limits per media type (image / video)."

#: ../../intro.md:21
msgid ""
"**图片管理**：列表（游标或页码分页，页码模式默认每页 15 并支持 ←/→ 翻页）、关键词与标签筛选、 单张详情、单张删除与批量操作、标题 / "
"相册 / 可见性 / 标签 / 广场发布开关、复制分享模板 （URL / HTML / Markdown / rST / 文件名 / "
"相册）；管理员可一键切到「全站」视图（仅公开图片）。"
msgstr ""
"**Image management**: list (cursor or page pagination; page mode defaults "
"to 15 per page with ←/→), keyword and tag filters, single-image details, "
"single and batch operations, title / album / visibility / tags / plaza "
"toggle, copyable share templates (URL / HTML / Markdown / rST / filename / "
"album); administrators can switch to a site-wide view in one click (public "
"images only)."

#: ../../intro.md:24
msgid ""
"**相册**：相册是独立实体（名称 / 描述 / 封面），可见性按相册（public / private / shared）， "
"单张图片可覆盖；支持按用户名分享成员并授予 read / write 权限与有效期。"
msgstr ""
"**Albums**: albums are first-class (name / description / cover) and carry "
"the visibility (public / private / shared), which a single image can "
"override; members can be shared by username with read / write permission "
"and an expiry."

#: ../../intro.md:26
msgid ""
"**账号**：本地注册（禁用词、密码强度）、注册审核（含拒绝理由与通知邮件）、邮箱验证、 找回密码、头像裁剪、个人偏好、多枚 PAT（`read` /"
" `upload` / `write` / `admin` 四档 scope）、 会话吊销、自助注销。"
msgstr ""
"**Accounts**: local registration (blocked words, password strength), "
"registration review (with a reason and a notification email), email "
"verification, password reset, avatar cropping, personal preferences, "
"multiple PATs (`read` / `upload` / `write` / `admin` scopes), session "
"revocation and self-service deletion."

#: ../../intro.md:29
msgid ""
"**存储**：多后端 + 优先级 + 多副本（主后端同步、其余异步），后台可增删改与单独配置； "
"用户自定义存储（`/api/v2/me/backends`，站点开关 `allow_user_backends`）。"
msgstr ""
"**Storage**: multiple backends with priority and replicas (the primary is "
"written synchronously, the rest asynchronously); add, edit, remove and "
"configure them in the admin, and user-owned backends too "
"(`/api/v2/me/backends`, site switch `allow_user_backends`)."

#: ../../intro.md:31
msgid ""
"**扩展**：内置本地 / 七牛 / 又拍云 / GitHub / Gitee 驱动、WebP 后处理、Passport OIDC 登录； "
"第三方包通过钩子体系接入，后台可安装、启停、配置。"
msgstr ""
"**Extensions**: built-in local / Qiniu / Upyun / GitHub / Gitee drivers, "
"WebP post-processing and Passport OIDC login; third-party packages plug in "
"through hooks and can be installed, toggled and configured in the admin."

#: ../../intro.md:33
msgid "**广场**：可选（默认关闭）的公开曝光渠道，与权限无关，只有主动发布的公开图片会进入。"
msgstr ""
"**Plaza**: an optional (off by default) public showcase channel, "
"independent of permissions — only images explicitly published as public get"
" listed."

#: ../../intro.md:35
msgid "不打算做的"
msgstr "Not planned"

#: ../../intro.md:37
msgid "个人 RSS（`/feed`）：匿名聚合出口会泄露「某用户有哪些图、何时上传」。"
msgstr ""
"Per-user RSS (`/feed`): an anonymous aggregation endpoint would leak which "
"images a user has and when they were uploaded."

#: ../../intro.md:38
msgid "`sendmail` 钩子、`token` 钩子、`/api/extendpoint`：分别被内置 SMTP、PAT、声明式动作取代。"
msgstr ""
"The `sendmail` hook, the `token` hook and `/api/extendpoint`: replaced by "
"the built-in SMTP support, PATs and declarative actions."

#: ../../intro.md:39
msgid ""
"v1 的 `/api/upload` 兼容层：维护双份上传语义的成本高于让客户端改一次配置， PicGo / uPic / Typora "
"等按[快捷上传](usage.md) 指向 `/api/v2/upload` 即可。"
msgstr ""
"The v1 `/api/upload` compatibility layer: maintaining two upload semantics "
"costs more than asking clients to change one setting — point PicGo / uPic /"
" Typora at `/api/v2/upload` as shown in [Quick upload](usage.md)."

#: ../../intro.md:41
msgid "前端多语言（界面固定中文，后端消息固定英文、由前端映射）。"
msgstr ""
"A multilingual front end (the UI is Chinese-only; backend messages are "
"always English and mapped by the front end)."

#: ../../intro.md:43
msgid ""
"想先跑起来看效果见[快速开始](quickstart.md)；架构细节见 `ARCH.md`，从 v1 迁移数据见 [从 v1 "
"迁移数据](migrate-v1.md)。"
msgstr ""
"To see it running first, read [Quick start](quickstart.md); architecture "
"details are in `ARCH.md` and migrating from v1 is in [Migrating data from "
"v1](migrate-v1.md)."

